# Last Ember

A single-file HTML5 survival shooter. You are the last light in the cold — aim, throw sparks, survive waves, and spend embers on upgrades.

**Play:** open `LastEmber.html` in Chrome (or any modern browser). Click once to unlock audio.

---

## How to play

- **Aim** — mouse, touch drag, or left stick on a gamepad  
- **Fire** — hold click / touch, or A / RT / RB on a gamepad  
- **Goal** — clear waves without letting enemies touch the ember  
- **Shop** — between waves, spend ◆ embers on upgrades  
- **Bosses** — every 5 waves  

---

## Features

### Combat & juice
- Combo streaks with announcer callouts (Sparked → Apocalypse)
- Near-miss sparks, aim trail, combo heat ring around the ember
- Hitstop, screen shake, chromatic flash on big hits
- Impact star bursts, ash particles when you take damage
- Low-HP vignette and heat haze
- Boss nameplate intro, enrage stingers, wave-clear camera punch

### Progression
- Large upgrade pool (common → legendary): fire rate, pierce, nova, magnet, chain spark, phoenix, inferno core, and more
- Wave modifiers: Swarm, Armored, Blizzard, Pincer
- Weekly challenge (date-based modifier bias)
- Practice arena — free upgrades, no leaderboard pressure

### Meta
- Main menu with live ambient combat in the background
- Local leaderboard, speedrun board, and last-20 run history
- Name entry (Apply button) + share codes (copy / import)
- Ghost of your best-wave aim path
- Settings: speedrun timer, screen shake, colorblind palette, particle quality, damage numbers, sound

### Tech
- Single HTML file — no install, no build step  
- Canvas + Web Audio (procedural SFX & dynamic music stems)  
- Gamepad support · touch · keyboard pause  
- Dark/light theme · localStorage persistence  

