## Controls

| Input | Action |
|--------|--------|
| Mouse / touch | Aim and hold to fire |
| Gamepad stick | Aim |
| A / RT / RB | Fire |
| Start (gamepad) / II button | Pause |
| ⚙ | Settings |
| ◐ | Theme |
| ♪ | Mute |

---

## Tips

1. Type your name and press **Apply** before playing so runs save under your name.  
2. Turn on **Speedrun timer** in Settings if you want time on the HUD and speed board.  
3. **Practice arena** is best for testing loadouts.  
4. Share codes on the game-over screen can be copied and imported from the main menu.  

